  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - PILOT GAS CONDENSATE PRODUCTION PROJECT, through Government of Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $723,659 technical assistance (TA) grant provides funding to prepare a pilot implementation of enhanced gas production techniques for AC &quot;Ukrgasvydobuvannya &quot; the primary Ukrainian state-owned gas production company. The TA provides the Grantee an assessment of the available advanced technical options, operational viability and economics of producing gas condensate fields among its operating assets.</narrative>
  </description>
